ent-AmnesiacAGasGrenade = amnesiac gas grenade
    .desc = A grenade with class A amnesiac for mass use. Causes drowsiness and erases the last 15 minutes of memories.
ent-FlameGasGrenade = flammable grenade
    .desc = A grenade containing an extremely dangerous gas that ignites instantly upon contact with air. It is best to avoid contact with it... We wouldn't want fried soldiers, would we?
ent-ToxinGasGrenade = toxic grenade
    .desc = A grenade containing an extremely dangerous, toxic gas. It is recommended to put on a gas mask before use-unless you value your lungs.
